Warning [L0801]: lambda stored a copy of `nums`; write `take(nums)` on the lambda to move it instead
  --> tests/ui_lint/lambda_escape_clone.jet:3:13
    |
  3 |     val f = (n: Int) => nums.len() + n;
    |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: a stored lambda owns its captures — clonable values are copied silently
 Fix: use `take(nums) (…) => …` to move `nums`, or `.clone()` at the call site to copy on purpose
